# --max-diagram-height: beautiful-mermaid's tall diagram gets its width capped at the height
# times its aspect ratio
@ source mermaid-tall.md
@ mermaid beautiful-mermaid
@ height 200px
+ --mdr-diagram-max-height: 200px;
=1 max-width: min(100%, calc(var(--mdr-diagram-max-height) * 0.
=1 class="beautiful-mermaid"
